From 4f750816403af1bc218b7800c553f58ec4188244 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dinesh Sudham <dineshx.sudham@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2020 17:00:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] DRVLIB_SW-3941:GSWAPI: Marking TFLOW rule entry is valid or
 invalid

PCE RULE can be mark as invalid without deleting Rule pattern and action,
this will enable the mark rule valid or invalid without rule deletion.

Signed-off-by: Dinesh Sudham <dineshx.sudham@intel.com>
---
